    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All that remains is... nothingness?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "He looks at the rhombus, it appears to be\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...An eye staring at me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "For the first time in his life, Theresis feels a shiver run down his spine."
    },
    {
        "text": "But it isn't his own instinctive reaction. He feels that a force, a will he can't see is trying to make him submit."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
