        "roz": 50,
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be you a god, or my creator, come out and face me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dead silence, cold. There is no response from the void."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Master. You shouldn't have come here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Her Highness has already made a terrible, reckless mistake. I do not want to lose another person I care about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Ascalon'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Master, leave this place. The time is not yet right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Ascalon'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should not use her to mock me, oh self-proclaimed <i>Creator.</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Ascalon standing before him is no illusion. This marvelous space has materialized his memories."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In my memories, you are the same as before, just a little less mature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Ascalon'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since those who truly control this place dare not face me directly, then Theresa has indeed succeeded. They must have already been subjected to numerous restrictions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, those arrogant beings wouldn't have tried to get you to stop me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresis raises his sword."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still do not wish to leave with me, Master?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Ascalon'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you really want to take me away, then defeat me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As you wish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Ascalon'"
    },
