        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Ascalon' disappears into a purple haze. She's used her Originium Arts."
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresis thinks back to the day he and Theresa led the remnants of the Sarkaz army into that storm..."
    },
    {
        "text": "The day he walked into the purple smoke alone and took the knife from that girl's hands... just as he does again."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It has been some time, Ascalon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
